          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%'><div style='position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background-color:#1b3a6b;background-image:linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb,#2a5aa0 26%,transparent) 0.12cqw,transparent 0.12cqw),linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,#2a5aa0 26%,transparent) 0.12cqw,transparent 0.12cqw),linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb,#2a5aa0 12%,transparent) 0.08cqw,transparent 0.08cqw),linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,#2a5aa0 12%,transparent) 0.08cqw,transparent 0.08cqw);background-size:10cqw 10cqw,10cqw 10cqw,2cqw 2cqw,2cqw 2cqw;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ffffff'><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:3.4cqw;font:800 1.5cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f5c542'>Starter</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;top:6.2cqw;font:800 6.6cqw/.9 Archivo Black,Impact,Haettenschweiler,Arial Black,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Your first graph</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;top:14.34cqw;font:400 2.5cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#cfe0ff;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Nodes, and how they relate. This one is yours: change anything.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:23.200000000000003cqw;font:400 1.7cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#f5c542'>A graph is nodes, and how they relate.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:27.6cqw;width:92cqw;height:30.166666666666657cqw;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:2cqw;background:color-mix(in srgb,#f5c542 7%,#1b3a6b);border:.3cqw solid color-mix(in srgb,#f5c542 28%,#1b3a6b)'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:23.05cqw;top:35.290000000000006cqw;width:2.6cqw;height:2.6cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#f5c542;color:#1b3a6b;font:800 1.5cqw/2.6cqw system-ui,sans-serif;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 0 0 .3cqw #1b3a6b'>1</div><div style='position:absolute;left:42.61cqw;top:41.370000000000005cqw;width:2.6cqw;height:2.6cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#f5c542;color:#1b3a6b;font:800 1.5cqw/2.6cqw system-ui,sans-serif;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 0 0 .3cqw #1b3a6b'>2</div><div style='position:absolute;left:62.18cqw;top:35.290000000000006cqw;width:2.6cqw;height:2.6cqw;border-radius:50%;background:#f5c542;color:#1b3a6b;font:800 1.5cqw/2.6cqw system-ui,sans-serif;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 0 0 .3cqw #1b3a6b'>3</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;bottom:2.4cqw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.7cqw 2.4cqw;font:700 1.4cqw/1.25 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#f5c542'><span>1 <em style='font-style:normal;font-weight:500;color:#cfe0ff'>a node: one thing in a box; drag its corner to resize it</em></span><span>2 <em style='font-style:normal;font-weight:500;color:#cfe0ff'>an edge joins two nodes: drag from a handle on one to the other</em></span><span>3 <em style='font-style:normal;font-weight:500;color:#cfe0ff'>the name on an edge says how they relate</em></span></div><div style='position:absolute;right:4cqw;top:3cqw;display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;font:700 1.9cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap'><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/tutorial/root.node' style='color:#f5c542;text-decoration:none'>Start here →</a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/primitives/root/root.node' style='color:#f5c542;text-decoration:none'>What a graph is →</a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/root.node' style='color:#f5c542;text-decoration:none'>The Twilite Zone →</a></div></div></div>"
